#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<strxfrm()> function transforms the I<src> string into a form such "
#| "that the result of B<strcmp()> on two strings that have been transformed "
#| "with B<strxfrm()> is the same as the result of B<strcoll()> on the two "
#| "strings before their transformation.  The first I<n> characters of the "
#| "transformed string are placed in I<dest>.  The transformation is based on "
#| "the program's current locale for category I<LC_COLLATE>.  (See "
#| "B<setlocale>(3))."
msgid ""
"The B<strxfrm>()  function transforms the I<src> string into a form such "
"that the result of B<strcmp>(3)  on two strings that have been transformed "
"with B<strxfrm>()  is the same as the result of B<strcoll>(3)  on the two "
"strings before their transformation.  The first I<n> bytes of the "
"transformed string are placed in I<dest>.  The transformation is based on "
"the program's current locale for category B<LC_COLLATE>.  (See "
"B<setlocale>(3))."
msgstr ""
"La función B<strxfrm()> transforma la cadena de caracteres I<orig> a una "
"forma tal que el resultado de llamar a B<strcmp()> sobre dos cadenas que han "
"sido transformadas mediante B<strxfrm()> es el mismo que el de llamar a "
"B<strcoll()> en las dos cadenas antes de su transformación. Los primeros "
"I<n> caracteres de la cadena transformada se colocan en I<dest>. La "
"transformación se basa en la localización en curso para la categoría "
"I<LC_COLLATE>.  (Vea B<setlocale>(3))."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "VALOR DEVUELTO"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<strxfrm()> function returns the number of bytes required to store "
#| "the transformed string in I<dest> excluding the terminating `\\e0' "
#| "character.  If the value returned is I<n> or more, the contents of "
#| "I<dest> are indeterminate."
msgid ""
"The B<strxfrm>()  function returns the number of bytes required to store the "
"transformed string in I<dest> excluding the terminating null byte "
"(\\[aq]\\[rs]0\\[aq]).  If the value returned is I<n> or more, the contents "
"of I<dest> are indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"La función B<strxfrm()> devuelve el número de bytes requeridos para guardar "
"la cadena transformada en I<dest> excluyendo el carácter terminador '\\e0'.  "
"Si el valor devuelto es I<n> o más, los contenidos de I<dest> son "
"indeterminados."

